WEBVTT

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:03.140
Hey... Hey.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:08.220
Hey, are you okay?

00:00:14.230 --> 00:00:15.430
That hurt...

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:19.390
You know, I did that because 
I was worried about you.

00:00:19.390 --> 00:00:21.670
What the hell is your problem?!

00:00:25.010 --> 00:00:26.900
D-Wheels.

00:00:27.010 --> 00:00:30.680
Riding duels are fought while 
racing on these machines,

00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:32.480
which are an evolution of the duel disks.

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:35.930
They combine speed and thrills for the ultimate show,

00:00:35.930 --> 00:00:38.100
a symbol of freedom to all.

00:02:12.080 --> 00:02:16.980
The Synchro Dimension 
"City"

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:27.670
Looks like it wasn't broken, but...

00:02:28.340 --> 00:02:30.360
Seriously, be careful, okay?

00:02:30.820 --> 00:02:33.080
I worked hard to build this thing.

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:34.830
Where are we?

00:02:35.510 --> 00:02:36.570
City.

00:02:36.930 --> 00:02:38.390
It's where I was born.

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:49.260
What about the battle royal?

00:02:49.260 --> 00:02:51.150
Huh? The what?

00:02:51.800 --> 00:02:54.570
The battle royal for the Junior Youth selection!

00:02:54.570 --> 00:02:56.440
In the Maiami Championship!

00:02:58.000 --> 00:03:03.160
That's right. I was attacked by that Academia 
duelist who looked just like Yuya...

00:03:03.860 --> 00:03:07.970
My bracelet lit up, and next thing I knew, 
he was gone, and this boy appeared.

00:03:10.060 --> 00:03:11.170
Rin!

00:03:11.800 --> 00:03:14.360
You're safe! I've been trying to find you, Rin!

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:17.340
W-Wait a minute! Who's Rin?

00:03:17.680 --> 00:03:18.310
What's that?

00:03:18.310 --> 00:03:19.210
That light again...

00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:27.270
Is it possible it sent me away with him?

00:03:29.410 --> 00:03:34.150
Hugo is another guy who looks like me.

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:39.770
Looks like Yuya...

00:03:40.770 --> 00:03:44.060
Hey... Are you Hugo?

00:03:44.060 --> 00:03:47.020
Wow, I'm surprised you know my name.

00:03:47.020 --> 00:03:49.410
Are you connected with Fusion?

00:03:49.860 --> 00:03:54.030
Not "Fusion"! My name's "Hugo"!

00:03:54.030 --> 00:03:55.380
Get it right!

00:03:58.230 --> 00:04:00.140
I thought so. You're not Rin.

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:04.290
Rin would never get my name wrong.

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:05.610
Rin?

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:08.720
Not bad.

00:04:08.720 --> 00:04:12.520
You're just like Ruri and Rin.

00:04:14.850 --> 00:04:19.740
Back then, the Academia duelist 
who tried to take me

00:04:19.740 --> 00:04:21.710
said he also took Ruri and Rin.

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:25.210
What? You met the guy who took Rin?

00:04:25.940 --> 00:04:29.950
I was dueling him until just before you appeared.

00:04:30.390 --> 00:04:31.870
Who is Rin?

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:33.420
Where is she now?

00:04:36.070 --> 00:04:37.190
I don't know.

00:04:38.070 --> 00:04:42.640
Right afterward, the bracelet lit up, 
and he disappeared.

00:04:42.640 --> 00:04:43.700
Disappeared?

00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:47.820
That's when you appeared.

00:04:50.120 --> 00:04:54.540
The bracelet has lit up many times before...

00:04:54.920 --> 00:04:59.510
And it always happens when I'm with 
someone who looks just like Yuya.

00:05:04.550 --> 00:05:07.120
By the time the light dies out,

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:10.580
the man disappears, and then Yuya shows up.

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:15.480
So, when you appeared, I was sure you were Yuya!

00:05:20.450 --> 00:05:24.480
After that, the bracelet lit up once more...

00:05:24.480 --> 00:05:26.220
And the next thing I knew, I was here.

00:05:27.010 --> 00:05:29.160
This isn't Maiami City, is it?

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:32.180
The town where I live?

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:34.540
I told you, it's called "City."

00:05:34.540 --> 00:05:35.510
City?

00:05:36.130 --> 00:05:38.020
The town where I was born and raised.

00:05:38.450 --> 00:05:41.120
It's in a different dimension from 
your Standard Dimension.

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:43.020
A different dimension?

00:05:43.020 --> 00:05:45.010
I guess it makes sense you're surprised.

00:05:45.010 --> 00:05:47.680
Is this your first time being 
sent through dimensions?

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:50.250
I'm in another dimension?

00:05:50.250 --> 00:05:54.870
Yeah. Take it from a guy who's 
traveled between them a lot!

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:59.200
Though, to me, this is coming home...

00:06:01.080 --> 00:06:04.270
Anyway, the first time I traveled dimensions,

00:06:04.270 --> 00:06:06.120
I was scared out of my mind.

00:06:08.420 --> 00:06:11.220
That was when Rin was taken away.

00:06:12.500 --> 00:06:16.280
Just before that, Rin said she thought 
she was being followed.

00:06:16.950 --> 00:06:19.930
I was keeping an eye on her to protect her.

00:06:26.450 --> 00:06:28.800
That's the end of our game of hide-and-seek.

00:06:32.340 --> 00:06:35.470
Now, come along with me...

00:06:35.980 --> 00:06:38.210
To the Professor.

00:06:42.400 --> 00:06:44.460
Damn... Where are you?

00:06:45.220 --> 00:06:46.390
Rin!

00:06:53.860 --> 00:06:56.590
Damn you, where are you taking Rin?!

00:06:58.510 --> 00:07:00.870
What? He looks just like me...

00:07:01.830 --> 00:07:05.670
I activate my spell card Violet Flash.

00:07:12.310 --> 00:07:13.240
Rin!

00:07:19.190 --> 00:07:21.720
Damn it!

00:07:34.900 --> 00:07:36.200
Clear Wing?

00:07:36.910 --> 00:07:38.900
Wh-Why?

00:07:47.540 --> 00:07:51.020
The next thing I knew, I was in Heartland.

00:07:51.490 --> 00:07:52.840
Heartland?

00:07:52.840 --> 00:07:55.100
In the Xyz Dimension?

00:07:55.100 --> 00:07:55.990
Yeah.

00:07:56.790 --> 00:07:59.960
I still don't know why I was sent there.

00:08:02.560 --> 00:08:04.950
What is this place?

00:08:05.440 --> 00:08:10.360
I thought that, perhaps, Rin might 
be somewhere in that ruined city.

00:08:10.360 --> 00:08:11.850
So I drove around, searching.

00:08:15.860 --> 00:08:19.420
Rin! Hey, are you here, Rin?

00:08:19.420 --> 00:08:22.280
If you're there, answer me, Rin!

00:08:25.180 --> 00:08:26.680
You're...

00:08:28.880 --> 00:08:31.190
I found you! You won't escape again!

00:08:31.560 --> 00:08:33.160
Are you with Academia, too?

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:36.960
I'm asking if you're Fusion.

00:08:36.960 --> 00:08:38.460
Don't call me "Fusion."

00:08:38.460 --> 00:08:40.260
I'm Hugo!

00:08:40.260 --> 00:08:42.630
And I won't be satisfied until I beat you up!

00:08:44.240 --> 00:08:45.960
So, you are Fusion!

00:08:48.070 --> 00:08:50.810
Listen to what I'm saying!

00:08:51.520 --> 00:08:52.140
Duel!

00:08:55.240 --> 00:08:57.190
Your opponent in that duel...

00:08:57.640 --> 00:09:00.550
He was an Xyz-user with the same face as I have.

00:09:00.980 --> 00:09:03.370
I wanted to get Rin back from him!

00:09:03.370 --> 00:09:06.270
That wasn't him! It was Ute!

00:09:06.270 --> 00:09:06.990
Ute?

00:09:07.490 --> 00:09:11.460
Ute is trying to save Ruri, who was 
kidnapped in the Xyz Dimension.

00:09:11.910 --> 00:09:15.480
He would never kidnap someone you care for!

00:09:15.480 --> 00:09:17.530
C-Care for?

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:20.200
That isn't right? Isn't Rin your girlfriend?

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:22.230
No, no, no, no, no, no, no!

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:25.160
We're just childhood friends.

00:09:25.160 --> 00:09:27.740
We're not dating or anything.

00:09:27.740 --> 00:09:31.530
I mean, we haven't done anything...

00:09:29.580 --> 00:09:32.470
Then why were you in Heartland?

00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:38.160
This card let me go after her.

00:09:40.050 --> 00:09:43.430
Maybe it realized how much 
I wanted to save her.

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:48.100
You mean, the one who kidnapped Rin...

00:09:48.530 --> 00:09:49.830
He might have been there!

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:54.100
While you were dueling Ute, 
he could have been nearby.

00:09:57.200 --> 00:10:00.910
What? You mean I just got the wrong guy?

00:10:01.380 --> 00:10:05.150
I'm pretty sure the Academia duelist 
that tried to kidnap me

00:10:05.880 --> 00:10:07.620
looked a lot like Ute.

00:10:08.050 --> 00:10:09.590
And they both look like you, too.

00:10:11.310 --> 00:10:13.060
And like Yuya.

00:10:14.710 --> 00:10:18.410
I think the fact that Yuya appeared 
when I was with Ute,

00:10:18.410 --> 00:10:22.430
and that you appeared when 
he tried to take me away...

00:10:23.030 --> 00:10:25.020
They probably weren't coincidences.

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:27.700
Not coincidences?

00:10:28.240 --> 00:10:32.880
Then, my Clear Wing Synchro 
Dragon made it all happen?

00:10:33.570 --> 00:10:34.960
I don't know.

00:10:34.960 --> 00:10:38.250
But if you're all...

00:10:38.250 --> 00:10:39.280
We're all what?

00:10:41.140 --> 00:10:44.820
People with the same faces 
are being drawn together.

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:52.200
Now that you mention it, that guy had my face, too.

00:10:52.740 --> 00:10:57.360
No, no, no... Hang on. It's just chance 
that there are guys who look like me.

00:10:57.360 --> 00:10:58.120
It's...

00:10:58.120 --> 00:10:59.660
It isn't just you.

00:11:04.760 --> 00:11:05.740
Are you...

00:11:07.140 --> 00:11:11.180
There are two others who look like Rin and me.

00:11:11.780 --> 00:11:14.790
One is Ruri. The other is Serena.

00:11:15.040 --> 00:11:16.070
Serena?

00:11:16.760 --> 00:11:20.490
She's an Academia duelist, like the guy who came

00:11:20.960 --> 00:11:22.710
to abduct Ruri, Rin, and me.

00:11:26.390 --> 00:11:29.600
This world is divided into four dimensions.

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:35.670
Fusion, Synchro, Xyz, and Standard.

00:11:36.390 --> 00:11:38.570
The Fusion Dimension, Academia,

00:11:38.570 --> 00:11:41.910
is trying to unite all the dimensions into one.

00:11:42.310 --> 00:11:43.860
All four into one?

00:11:44.360 --> 00:11:47.980
To achieve that, Academia is 
even willing to start a war.

00:11:48.740 --> 00:11:50.990
They'd go that far?

00:11:50.990 --> 00:11:54.810
So this Serena girl is working with 
the guy who kidnapped Rin,

00:11:54.810 --> 00:11:56.660
and she's part of the evil army?

00:11:56.960 --> 00:12:01.000
Yeah, but Academia is after her now.

00:12:01.460 --> 00:12:03.200
After her? Why?

00:12:03.730 --> 00:12:07.710
The man in charge of Academia, 
known as the Professor,

00:12:07.710 --> 00:12:11.720
seeks to gather people who look 
like Ruri, Rin, and me.

00:12:12.450 --> 00:12:14.460
So I'm sure he'd want Serena, too.

00:12:16.900 --> 00:12:21.550
I don't know why the Professor wants us.

00:12:22.020 --> 00:12:25.750
Why do the four of us share the same face?

00:12:26.260 --> 00:12:29.270
Why do you four look alike, too?

00:12:29.750 --> 00:12:30.810
I get it!

00:12:32.420 --> 00:12:35.770
That means that Rin is in this Academia place, right?

00:12:38.790 --> 00:12:39.480
Let's go.

00:12:39.960 --> 00:12:41.420
Go? Where?

00:12:41.420 --> 00:12:42.640
Isn't it obvious?

00:12:42.980 --> 00:12:45.040
Now that I know where Rin is,

00:12:45.040 --> 00:12:47.610
we just have to go there and bring her back!

00:12:47.880 --> 00:12:50.110
Go? To Academia?

00:12:50.110 --> 00:12:51.360
But how?

00:12:51.360 --> 00:12:53.020
We'll just use this.

00:12:54.560 --> 00:12:57.820
This bracelet has the power 
to cross dimensions, right?

00:12:58.280 --> 00:13:00.810
It sent me back here with you.

00:13:01.220 --> 00:13:02.840
So if you get it to light up...

00:13:04.440 --> 00:13:05.740
It won't work.

00:13:05.740 --> 00:13:06.560
Why not?

00:13:07.430 --> 00:13:10.540
Because I'm not the one who makes it light up.

00:13:12.210 --> 00:13:14.120
I told you, remember?

00:13:14.120 --> 00:13:18.440
Just before Yuya appears, it lights up when I'm with

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:20.600
someone who looks like Yuya.

00:13:21.490 --> 00:13:24.980
Then, we need to bring this Yuya guy here, right?

00:13:26.070 --> 00:13:27.550
That's impossible.

00:13:27.920 --> 00:13:29.520
Why is it impossible?

00:13:30.850 --> 00:13:32.020
Because...

00:13:32.980 --> 00:13:34.490
Because...

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:36.420
Yuya...

00:13:37.640 --> 00:13:39.480
Yuya isn't here!

00:13:56.410 --> 00:13:57.170
Here.

00:14:00.870 --> 00:14:03.620
Sorry. I was a jerk.

00:14:05.730 --> 00:14:07.050
Thanks...

00:14:11.300 --> 00:14:12.750
I feel the same way.

00:14:12.750 --> 00:14:16.160
If I could use this bracelet to freely travel dimensions,

00:14:16.160 --> 00:14:18.290
I'd go back right now.

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:22.540
To where Yuya, my father, and everyone is waiting.

00:14:24.100 --> 00:14:27.510
Can't you do anything with that card?

00:14:29.190 --> 00:14:33.820
Sorry... I can't make it shine at will, either.

00:14:39.300 --> 00:14:40.790
I really am sorry!

00:14:41.710 --> 00:14:45.610
I have a habit of just saying 
whatever springs to mind.

00:14:46.160 --> 00:14:49.800
Rin gets mad at me a lot. She says 
I need to think before I speak.

00:14:51.380 --> 00:14:53.270
She's a real loudmouth.

00:14:53.920 --> 00:14:57.240
"Don't do this, don't do that," all the time.

00:14:58.870 --> 00:15:00.210
She's like your mom!

00:15:00.870 --> 00:15:02.150
Yeah!

00:15:02.770 --> 00:15:07.590
Of course, neither Rin nor I know 
what our real moms look like.

00:15:13.720 --> 00:15:15.360
Don't touch that!

00:15:15.670 --> 00:15:16.860
No...

00:15:16.860 --> 00:15:20.110
Why would you do that? What if you got sick?

00:15:17.960 --> 00:15:19.330
What's wrong, Hugo?

00:15:22.450 --> 00:15:23.500
Someone!

00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:25.920
Someone come here! Someone!

00:15:25.920 --> 00:15:26.750
Hugo!

00:15:26.750 --> 00:15:27.370
Put this on!

00:15:27.370 --> 00:15:28.110
What's the matter?

00:15:28.110 --> 00:15:29.400
What happened?

00:15:29.400 --> 00:15:30.680
O-Over there...

00:15:31.140 --> 00:15:33.520
Over there! They're Commons!

00:15:36.530 --> 00:15:38.520
You two are Commons?

00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:40.580
This land is for Tops only!

00:15:40.840 --> 00:15:41.960
Oh, no...

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:42.550
Get on!

00:15:43.410 --> 00:15:45.310
Get everyone together!

00:15:43.890 --> 00:15:44.830
What's wrong?

00:15:44.830 --> 00:15:46.520
Just get on!

00:15:45.310 --> 00:15:47.070
There are Commons here!

00:15:48.810 --> 00:15:49.640
Wait!

00:15:53.330 --> 00:15:54.490
Are you okay?

00:15:55.200 --> 00:15:56.870
Contact security!

00:15:59.340 --> 00:16:03.090
Hey... Why did we run away?

00:16:03.090 --> 00:16:05.460
That was a Tops-only residential zone.

00:16:05.970 --> 00:16:09.550
I thought so, but I was so caught 
up with you, I forgot to leave.

00:16:09.960 --> 00:16:13.250
Why do we have to leave? What are Tops?

00:16:14.020 --> 00:16:17.240
Tops are society's highest rung, 
winners who possess

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:19.190
most of City's wealth and status.

00:16:19.600 --> 00:16:20.980
Winners?

00:16:21.510 --> 00:16:25.900
City is built on free societal movement, 
based on competition.

00:16:27.220 --> 00:16:29.640
The winners get everything.

00:16:29.640 --> 00:16:31.640
The losers lose everything.

00:16:32.580 --> 00:16:33.850
Why?

00:16:33.850 --> 00:16:37.340
That's competition. Those who win become Tops.

00:16:38.050 --> 00:16:42.010
They control 99% of the city's wealth.

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:46.320
Even though they're only 1% of the population.

00:16:46.600 --> 00:16:47.790
No way...

00:17:03.380 --> 00:17:04.540
It's beautiful!

00:17:05.170 --> 00:17:07.790
The light is amazing, isn't it?

00:17:08.560 --> 00:17:11.220
There's so much prosperity here.

00:17:13.750 --> 00:17:15.340
But beneath it...

00:17:22.130 --> 00:17:25.060
The remaining 99% lives there.

00:17:26.640 --> 00:17:30.220
Those are the slums, where our world 
of competition's losers live.

00:17:31.040 --> 00:17:33.030
The true hometown in which I was raised.

00:17:35.570 --> 00:17:41.460
Tops call us "slum-dwellers." 
The ordinary civilians, Commons.

00:17:41.460 --> 00:17:43.710
Though they treat us as equals on the surface,

00:17:43.710 --> 00:17:46.310
in their hearts, they scorn us as losers.

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:51.550
But we won't always be losers.

00:17:52.040 --> 00:17:54.750
I Synchro Summon Hi-Speedroid Kendama!

00:17:55.080 --> 00:17:57.960
I summon Lucky Pied Piper!

00:17:58.820 --> 00:18:03.160
City is a competitive, merit-based society, so you 
should be able to win your way to the top.

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:05.960
When we were kids, Rin and I decided

00:18:05.960 --> 00:18:08.310
that we would hone our dueling skills.

00:18:15.160 --> 00:18:19.200
A guy who was raised in the same facility 
as I was made it to a debut.

00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:21.190
There, it's coming into view.

00:18:26.720 --> 00:18:29.400
The Duel King, Jack Atlas.

00:18:29.400 --> 00:18:30.690
Duel King?

00:18:30.690 --> 00:18:33.990
Wheel of Fortune 
King's Entertainment Duels

00:18:31.110 --> 00:18:34.090
He's the first Common to be world champion.

00:18:34.040 --> 00:18:38.030
Get the Ultimate Satisfaction 
Wheel of Fortune

00:18:34.110 --> 00:18:38.240
He won City's ultimate duel festival, 
the Friendship Cup,

00:18:38.030 --> 00:18:41.430
The Lonely King's Style  
Wheel of Fortune

00:18:38.240 --> 00:18:40.130
and quickly rose to the top.

00:18:40.130 --> 00:18:41.430
He's our hero!

00:18:42.120 --> 00:18:46.630
If he could do it, and I was raised in 
the same facility, then I can, too.

00:18:47.190 --> 00:18:50.720
Rin and I used Jack as our example, 
and honed our skills.

00:18:50.720 --> 00:18:54.150
We dreamed of someday participating 
in the Friendship Cup

00:18:54.600 --> 00:18:57.980
and fighting Jack...

00:18:59.090 --> 00:19:00.180
Hugo...

00:19:03.060 --> 00:19:06.070
I built this D-Wheel with Rin.

00:19:06.480 --> 00:19:08.630
So I could fight a riding duel with Jack.

00:19:09.030 --> 00:19:10.600
A riding duel?

00:19:11.700 --> 00:19:14.370
D-Wheel ahead. Please stop at once.

00:19:15.230 --> 00:19:16.330
This is security.

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:19.600
D-Wheel ahead. Please stop at once.

00:19:19.600 --> 00:19:20.720
Damn...

00:19:20.720 --> 00:19:23.410
Those people from earlier reported us!

00:19:26.480 --> 00:19:28.990
Wait... Shouldn't you stop?

00:19:28.990 --> 00:19:30.950
They're the police, aren't they?

00:19:30.950 --> 00:19:32.960
They're the Tops' dogs.

00:19:32.960 --> 00:19:36.190
Lately, they've really had it in for us Commons.

00:19:36.560 --> 00:19:38.650
But running from them is still wrong.

00:19:38.650 --> 00:19:40.680
If they catch us, they'll throw us in prison!

00:19:40.680 --> 00:19:41.890
Prison?

